    "body": "My github moniker derives from my proofreading activities. The initial entry in this discussion:\r\n\r\n[readmes/mini-clue.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/readmes/mini-clue.md?plain=1#L80) (2 instances); [doc/mini-clue.txt](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/doc/mini-clue.txt#L75) (3 instances); [doc/mini-clue.txt](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/doc/mini-clue.txt#L75) (same 3):\r\n`full proof` -> `foolproof` -- \"foolproof\" is a single word meaning \"incapable of going wrong or being misused\".",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">My github moniker derives from my proofreading activities. The initial entry in this discussion:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/readmes/mini-clue.md?plain=1#L80\">readmes/mini-clue.md</a> (2 instances); <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/doc/mini-clue.txt#L75\">doc/mini-clue.txt</a> (3 instances); <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d7e05b30d842e543366ff5474076a0726f783a32/doc/mini-clue.txt#L75\">doc/mini-clue.txt</a> (same 3):<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">full proof</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">foolproof</code> -- \"foolproof\" is a single word meaning \"incapable of going wrong or being misused\".</p>",
